      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Best Treadmill Lubricant</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        The product choice is simpler than it looks: 100% silicone for most machines. The decision that actually matters is the applicator, and the check that matters most is whether your deck is pre-waxed.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
