        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#lube-n-walk-kit"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s-n+6rcBL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Lube-N-Walk Treadmill Lubricating Kit" width="500" height="495" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#silicone-spray-straw"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I-eOP1a9L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Techmotion 100% Silicone Belt &amp; Deck Lubricant Spray (TM-01309)" width="234" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#proprietary-wax"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FNMlbX2YL._SL500_.jpg" alt="TreadLife Fitness Treadmill Wax" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Lube-N-Walk Treadmill Lubricating Kit · Techmotion 100% Silicone Belt &amp; Deck Lubricant Spray (TM-01309) · TreadLife Fitness Treadmill Wax</figcaption>
      </figure>

